OL,3,GNEWSAPetrol bombers attack police for
OL,4,Asecond night running
OL,5,
OL,6,FPetrol bombers have attacked the police
OL,7,Fduring a second night of disorder in
OL,8,FLondonderry.
OL,10,FTrouble flared in the Top Of The Hill
OL,11,Farea of the Waterside on Monday
OL,12,Fevening.
OL,14,F"Petrol bombs were thrown at police and
OL,15,Fthere were just scenes of sheer
OL,16,Fviolence," said DUP MLA Julie
OL,17,FMiddleton. "It descended into chaos."
OL,19,FThe previous night, police were
OL,20,Ftargeted with petrol bombs, fireworks
OL,21,Fand bottles in the Strabane Old Road
OL,22,Fand Irish Street areas.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
